  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">De-Risking Green Hydrogen Finance in North Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The De-Risking Green Hydrogen Finance in North Africa initiative builds on the ongoing CERF hydrogen track in Egypt, developed with the Dutch Embassy in Cairo since 2023. Following earlier efforts such as the 2023 Force-Field Analysis on Hydrogen, the 2024 Multi-Stakeholder Workshop and mission, and current work on certification. This activity is a next step in advancing the enabling environment for investment. The initiative responds to the financial barriers that continue to limit largescale hydrogen development in North Africa, particularly high cost of capital and limited coordination among financiers.</narrative>
  </description>
